WEBVTT

00:08.960 --> 00:10.460
What is this?

00:10.460 --> 00:11.920
Where am I?!

00:11.920 --> 00:15.750
This is the night sky with
my memories strewn across it.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.130
Sakuna...

00:19.080 --> 00:23.080
Each one of these stars
is a memory of mine.

00:24.130 --> 00:27.000
A memory planetarium, so to speak.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.580
Wow. It's beautiful.

00:29.580 --> 00:33.000
No, it isn't anything of the sort.

00:34.670 --> 00:36.290
Take a look.

00:37.170 --> 00:39.710
That's the beginning of my memories.

00:47.210 --> 00:50.540
My big sister, Komari Memoir.

00:52.630 --> 00:55.330
She was truly a kind person.

00:57.830 --> 01:19.790
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

02:29.380 --> 02:36.000
<b>Wheels of Asterism</b>

02:33.830 --> 02:36.670
These days were very peaceful.

02:39.790 --> 02:43.880
My family all got on very well.

02:45.000 --> 02:50.580
On our holidays, we went stargazing.

02:51.540 --> 02:56.000
I think that's why I loved the stars.

02:57.670 --> 03:01.040
However... the days we did that,

03:01.040 --> 03:05.170
if I think about it now,
may have been just empty dreams.

03:06.130 --> 03:07.880
Miss Terakomari.

03:07.880 --> 03:12.080
Did you know that in this world,
there are "Wicked God Slayers"?

03:12.080 --> 03:13.580
What's that?

03:14.040 --> 03:16.630
God is the Dark Core here.

03:16.630 --> 03:22.040
That's because at present,
the Dark Core is treated is if it is God.

03:22.630 --> 03:27.210
"People that will slay the Dark Core,"
in other words, "Inverse Moon."

03:27.210 --> 03:29.460
Inverse... Moon...

03:33.080 --> 03:37.380
They will do anything in order to
destroy the Dark Core.

03:52.040 --> 03:57.330
They don't even hesitate
to slaughter peaceful families.

03:57.830 --> 04:02.080
B-but... they'll be revived
if there's a Dark Core, right?

04:02.080 --> 04:03.830
They won't.

04:04.630 --> 04:09.040
My family was sliced to pieces
by a ritual article

04:09.040 --> 04:11.580
that renders the Dark Core ineffective.

04:11.580 --> 04:13.540
Why did that happen?

04:13.540 --> 04:16.000
There was one single motive:

04:16.000 --> 04:20.540
to embed despair into me,
and make me a pawn in the organization.

04:21.880 --> 04:24.880
It seems they found me useful.

04:25.540 --> 04:27.290
Useful?

04:27.290 --> 04:31.330
Core Implosion, "Wheels of Asterism."

04:32.250 --> 04:36.040
It's an ability where I can manipulate
the memories of those I've killed.

04:36.880 --> 04:40.000
The man who killed my family told me this:

04:40.580 --> 04:45.080
"As a member of Inverse Moon,
if you do your absolute best,

04:45.080 --> 04:49.080
I can tell you a way
to get your family back."

04:50.330 --> 04:55.210
And that's how I was forced to
become a terrorist.

04:55.960 --> 04:58.420
The task given to me was simple...

05:06.880 --> 05:12.080
It was to manipulate memories and
extract information about the Dark Core.

05:12.540 --> 05:14.170
That was it.

05:14.830 --> 05:18.460
You were the one who killed my Dad.

05:18.960 --> 05:20.580
I'm sorry.

05:20.580 --> 05:24.130
If I failed my task, my family...

05:24.130 --> 05:27.330
they told me they'd kill my precious family.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.960
Time and time again,

05:29.960 --> 05:33.830
every time I felt I was falling apart,
they'd say they'll kill my family...

05:33.830 --> 05:35.830
over and over again.

05:38.750 --> 05:40.500
Miss Terakomari.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.960
I'm going to kill you.

05:43.210 --> 05:45.460
I have no idea where the Dark Core is!

05:45.460 --> 05:47.630
There's no point in killing me!

05:47.630 --> 05:50.540
Then let's kill each other.

06:02.250 --> 06:04.290
To be honest, I don't want to.

06:04.290 --> 06:08.580
I'm hardly a match for you.

06:09.460 --> 06:12.330
But even so, I have to fight,

06:12.330 --> 06:15.290
because my family may be
killed once again.

06:15.290 --> 06:18.380
W-wait a second. I don't understand...

06:18.380 --> 06:21.170
You've already lost your family, haven't you?

06:21.170 --> 06:23.210
No, I have family. Right here.

06:24.130 --> 06:28.170
Miss Terakomari, you will
become my big sister.

06:28.170 --> 06:29.540
Big sister?

06:29.920 --> 06:32.830
Then, I've made a family.

06:32.830 --> 06:36.670
I find a person with a beautiful
constellation shape,

06:36.670 --> 06:39.290
and rearrange that person's memories...

06:39.580 --> 06:41.830
For example, my father...

06:41.830 --> 06:46.540
Helldeus Heaven doesn't
resemble my father at all, but...

06:46.540 --> 06:49.540
he had a beautiful Aquila constellation, so...

06:49.540 --> 06:52.750
He is my father, without doubt.

06:54.540 --> 06:58.750
I'm going to rearrange your
memories too, Miss Terakomari.

07:00.170 --> 07:02.380
Please stay still.

07:03.210 --> 07:05.460
I'll try to make it as painless as possible.

07:12.960 --> 07:14.880
I'll be her, you know.

07:15.210 --> 07:17.330
I'll become your big sister.

07:18.130 --> 07:20.170
Do you mean it?

07:20.170 --> 07:23.080
However! I don't want to get killed!

07:23.080 --> 07:23.880
Huh?

07:23.880 --> 07:28.080
Listen up, your big sister is
the only one you have in the world.

07:28.080 --> 07:30.790
But even so, rearranging
someone else's memories

07:30.790 --> 07:32.830
to take the place of your big sister

07:32.830 --> 07:35.380
is quite rude to your real big sister!

07:37.000 --> 07:38.830
I know that.

07:38.830 --> 07:40.830
I know that I'm weird.

07:40.830 --> 07:43.830
Hm, you are quite the weird one.

07:44.630 --> 07:48.710
But, though I know that,
it's been so painful...

07:49.130 --> 07:51.210
so things ended up like this.

07:59.540 --> 08:01.250
Thank you.

08:01.960 --> 08:06.500
My real big sister would
comfort me like this, too.

08:06.880 --> 08:09.960
Oh yeah? She was a nice big sister, huh?

08:10.500 --> 08:12.670
Miss Terakomari, you're nice too.

08:12.670 --> 08:16.210
I'm not nice. I'm just weak.

08:16.210 --> 08:18.500
You really are nice.

08:19.750 --> 08:23.790
Miss Terakomari. Can I call you Big Sis?

08:23.790 --> 08:26.420
Sure, get doted on you
to your heart's content!

08:29.670 --> 08:30.880
Big Sis.

08:30.880 --> 08:32.080
Yeah...

08:33.830 --> 08:37.130
What are you doing, Sakuna Memoir?

08:37.630 --> 08:38.670
Odilon?

08:38.670 --> 08:40.330
You were supposed to
contact me, weren't you?

08:40.330 --> 08:42.380
You said you'd kill Gandesblood.

08:42.380 --> 08:43.330
Huh?

08:43.330 --> 08:44.580
I-I know.

08:44.580 --> 08:46.000
You know?

08:46.000 --> 08:47.540
What is it that you know?

08:49.130 --> 08:49.960
Sakuna!

08:49.960 --> 08:52.380
Well then, why is Gandesblood free of injury?

08:52.380 --> 08:56.250
Why are you smiling like a fool
with that girl?

08:56.250 --> 08:58.460
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

08:58.460 --> 08:59.750
You pest!

08:59.750 --> 09:03.630
Are you listening to me, Sakuna Memoir?!

09:03.960 --> 09:05.330
Stand up this instant!

09:05.330 --> 09:07.250
Rise and murder that runt of a girl!

09:07.250 --> 09:08.080
Stop it!

09:10.500 --> 09:15.080
You were the reason why Sakuna
was shoved to the depths of Hell!

09:17.130 --> 09:18.710
Sakuna Memoir!

09:18.710 --> 09:21.880
You will open your eyes right now
and murder that girl!

09:23.880 --> 09:26.920
I told you to stop!

09:28.830 --> 09:30.630
How sad.

09:30.630 --> 09:34.710
There's nothing more unbearable
than watching the powerless resist.

09:34.710 --> 09:38.960
S-stop... let go... I said let go!

09:43.710 --> 09:47.130
You are beyond fragile,
Terakomari Gandesblood!

09:49.210 --> 09:54.750
If you are this fragile, there's no need
to even use Sakuna Memoir's ability!

09:54.750 --> 09:57.670
Well, I suppose I'll torture you then!

09:57.670 --> 09:59.880
Get away from Miss Terakomari!

10:01.790 --> 10:05.040
Don't do anything bad to Miss Terakomari!

10:05.580 --> 10:09.000
What are you saying, Sakuna Memoir?

10:09.000 --> 10:12.170
I won't obey you any longer!

10:12.170 --> 10:14.170
I'm getting out of Inverse Moon!

10:14.170 --> 10:16.250
Don't be absurd!

10:16.250 --> 10:19.540
All you have to do is slave away
as my tool for the rest of your life!

10:19.540 --> 10:21.380
No, THAT'S absurd!

10:21.380 --> 10:24.170
I am completely done doing as you say!

10:24.170 --> 10:25.330
Hey, you can't be serious?!

10:25.330 --> 10:28.750
The Cornelius's elixir that you gave me!

10:40.170 --> 10:44.540
Even if I die here, I will make sure
I at least kill you!

10:45.210 --> 10:47.580
Dust Tail Comet!

10:48.250 --> 10:51.540
How dare you get so arrogant,
you're just a tool!

11:01.750 --> 11:03.880
You... You...

11:47.330 --> 11:51.250
Looks like you've been visited by
the drug's side effects, you idiot!

12:00.830 --> 12:04.880
Miss... Terakomari... I'm sorry.

12:05.380 --> 12:09.500
You're going through all of this horrible stuff
because you got involved with me...

12:10.540 --> 12:12.250
I'm sorry....

12:12.580 --> 12:15.460
It's all over now.

12:16.040 --> 12:19.380
When things get tough,
let Terakomari drink your blood.

12:16.170 --> 12:17.920
<b>When things get tough, let Terakomari</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:18.420
<b>drink your blood.</b>

12:18.420 --> 12:19.380
<b>When things get tough, let Terakomari drink your blood.</b>

12:20.710 --> 12:24.080
That way, even if it kills her,
you'll be saved.

12:43.080 --> 12:45.540
You're finally awake, Gandesblood!

12:46.130 --> 12:49.710
I'm going to chop you up with my
ritual article, the Dapeng blade,

12:49.710 --> 12:53.000
until you spit out the location
of the Dark Core!

12:59.500 --> 13:01.380
Miss... Terakomari?

13:01.710 --> 13:04.420
There isn't enough blood...

13:05.880 --> 13:08.210
Eh... I-I can't...

13:17.210 --> 13:21.580
Looks like you have some
hidden gems, you witch.

13:44.500 --> 13:48.080
You will suffer until you apologize.

14:01.000 --> 14:04.250
Wh-what is that? Komari is so pale...

14:05.080 --> 14:07.670
The qualities of the
"Mercy of the Lonely Crimson"

14:07.670 --> 14:10.330
change depending on
the blood she's drank.

14:10.630 --> 14:13.670
Basically, that child's Core Implosion

14:13.670 --> 14:17.460
quite literally has the power to
level the Six Nations.

14:17.670 --> 14:20.710
Are you saying that the domination
that Yulinne could not achieve

14:20.710 --> 14:23.920
will be carried out through her daughter?

14:29.960 --> 14:31.500
In any event,

14:31.500 --> 14:34.710
we've finally gotten the identity
of the mastermind.

14:35.000 --> 14:38.210
Now, show us again, Komari.

14:38.670 --> 14:42.630
I'm sure you can turn this world on its head.

14:52.790 --> 14:53.960
Ridiculous.

14:53.960 --> 14:57.960
Cornelius' Elixir, refined by a ritual article...

14:57.960 --> 15:00.170
Eliminating its side effects and the like...

15:01.210 --> 15:06.040
Could it be... a magic that
doesn't rely on the Dark Core?

15:07.500 --> 15:09.080
Apologize to Sakuna.

15:09.500 --> 15:10.540
What?

15:11.130 --> 15:12.750
Apologize to Sakuna.

15:13.080 --> 15:16.750
Why must I ask forgiveness from a tool?!

15:17.000 --> 15:21.710
That girl is a faithful servant who has
sworn herself to Inverse Moon!

15:21.710 --> 15:25.080
What's wrong with her master
using her as he pleases?!

15:37.420 --> 15:41.040
Where did you go, Terakomari Gandesblood?!

15:41.380 --> 15:42.380
Right here.

15:51.580 --> 15:54.880
You stupid little girl!

15:58.290 --> 16:00.380
What... was that??

16:04.330 --> 16:07.210
Eh?! You damn little...!

16:07.210 --> 16:12.920
I swear I will kill you someday,
Terakomari Gandesblood!

16:15.000 --> 16:17.130
Core Implosion...

16:18.210 --> 16:20.540
"Wheels of Asterism!"

16:20.670 --> 16:23.790
<b>Gerra-Arka Republic</b>

16:20.670 --> 16:23.790
<b>Jungle Region</b>

16:23.880 --> 16:25.500
L-Lord Metal!

16:26.170 --> 16:27.290
Heal up, quickly!

16:27.290 --> 16:29.750
No, when we return to Mulnite,
the Dark Core will get you back to 100%...

16:29.750 --> 16:31.040
You fool!

16:31.040 --> 16:34.920
Relying on the Dark Core will bring
banishment from Inverse Moon, you bitch!

16:35.380 --> 16:38.080
Hey, Amatsu! The plan was a failure!

16:38.080 --> 16:41.170
And it's all the fault of
Terakomari Gandesblood!

16:42.080 --> 16:43.830
I know.

16:43.830 --> 16:47.210
The image is being relayed all over Mulnite.

16:47.210 --> 16:49.080
Then our conversation will be quick!

16:49.080 --> 16:52.130
I must come up with a plan to
murder her as soon as possible!

16:52.130 --> 16:54.290
I will make sure to destroy the Dark Core
next chance I get!

16:54.290 --> 16:55.040
Lord Odilon.
I will make sure to destroy the Dark Core<b>
</b>next chance I get!<b></b>

16:55.040 --> 16:55.630
Lord Odilon.
To that end...<b></b>

16:55.630 --> 16:56.460
To that end...

16:56.460 --> 16:57.920
Lord Odilon.

16:57.920 --> 16:59.500
Yeah? What do you want?!

17:00.880 --> 17:01.960
What?

17:02.670 --> 17:05.080
I'm not your tool.

17:11.500 --> 17:13.040
I'm not your tool.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.830
I'm not your tool...

17:15.040 --> 17:16.540
I'm not your tool...

17:16.830 --> 17:18.460
I'm not your tool...

17:20.540 --> 17:24.540
Sakuna Memoir!

17:29.670 --> 17:31.750
Serves him right.

17:38.380 --> 17:41.130
You've been deceived, huh, Odilon?

17:41.500 --> 17:45.250
Sakuna Memoir was temporarily
returning to the hideout,

17:45.250 --> 17:48.920
killing your men one by one
and brainwashing them.

17:48.920 --> 17:51.460
Why didn't you tell me
if you knew about it?!

17:51.460 --> 17:52.540
Damn it!

17:52.920 --> 17:56.170
Not only did I fail my mission,
all of my tools have been wiped out...

17:56.170 --> 18:00.630
After this debacle,
I'll never get another chance!

18:01.000 --> 18:03.210
Damn it! Damn, damn, damn it!

18:03.210 --> 18:06.830
It's all their fault!
If only they weren't here...

18:11.500 --> 18:13.000
You bitch...

18:16.210 --> 18:17.130
Apologize.

18:19.710 --> 18:21.830
Apologize to Sakuna.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.250
Why should I apologize?!

18:23.250 --> 18:26.170
A stupid girl like that deserves to be
thoroughly used and die!

18:28.960 --> 18:30.250
Go to Hell.

18:32.000 --> 18:35.130
The winner of the Crimson Lord's War is...

18:35.130 --> 18:38.880
Terakomari Gandesblood!

18:39.500 --> 18:43.040
<b>Several days later</b>

18:43.290 --> 18:45.540
Lady Komari, say "Ah."

18:45.540 --> 18:48.250
I-it's fine, I can feed myself.

18:48.250 --> 18:49.830
No, you can't.

18:49.830 --> 18:53.170
As a maid, I have the duty of nursing
my master back to health.

18:53.170 --> 18:55.250
But you got injured.

18:55.250 --> 18:57.710
I can't be nursed back to health
by the wounded.

18:57.960 --> 19:00.210
Then ask me to open wide.

19:00.210 --> 19:02.080
You can also feed me mouth-to-mouth.

19:02.420 --> 19:05.040
Feed yourself! And I'll do the same!

19:06.830 --> 19:08.080
Hello.

19:08.080 --> 19:10.750
Sakuna! Is your body okay?

19:10.750 --> 19:13.830
Yes. And it's all thanks to you.

19:14.670 --> 19:16.170
I'm sorry.

19:16.170 --> 19:19.290
I've cause you a lot of trouble.

19:19.290 --> 19:23.040
I won't say anymore about you
being my big sister.

19:23.460 --> 19:25.380
I'm truly very sorry.

19:25.380 --> 19:28.250
Okay. I totally don't mind at all though.

19:34.460 --> 19:36.880
Hey, why are you crying?

19:36.880 --> 19:39.210
Everyone says that...

19:42.880 --> 19:44.170
You're pardoned.

19:44.500 --> 19:45.670
Eh?

19:46.540 --> 19:49.790
Just work hard as a Crimson Lord
from here on out.

19:54.960 --> 19:57.250
I'm sorry I killed you.

19:58.750 --> 20:00.250
Don't worry about it.

20:01.380 --> 20:04.790
It's enough for me just to know
how strong you are.

20:05.630 --> 20:08.380
The Core Implosion didn't work?!

20:09.710 --> 20:12.790
I thought it was the end when you killed me,

20:12.790 --> 20:14.630
but I am still a Crimson Lord.

20:14.630 --> 20:19.130
My mind cannot be completely controlled
by a low-precision Core Implosion.

20:19.130 --> 20:20.250
But wait!

20:20.250 --> 20:22.880
In that case, why did you leave me there?!

20:22.880 --> 20:25.580
You knew I was in Inverse Moon, didn't you?

20:25.580 --> 20:28.080
Why didn't you punish me?!

20:28.540 --> 20:32.460
If I'm being truthful,
maybe I shouldn't have left you there.

20:32.460 --> 20:38.210
Maybe I should have killed Odilon Metal
as soon as possible, and saved you.

20:38.960 --> 20:41.170
But, I didn't do that.

20:41.170 --> 20:44.580
Because from the very beginning,
I expected you to get revenge

20:44.580 --> 20:47.580
on Inverse Moon by your own hand.

20:48.750 --> 20:53.250
God is what dwells in my heart,
that tries to overcome all adversity.

20:53.920 --> 21:01.000
And so, I thought that the least I can do
as your father is give emotional support.

21:01.000 --> 21:02.420
How...

21:02.420 --> 21:04.670
How can you stand to smile?!

21:04.670 --> 21:07.130
Even though I killed you...

21:07.130 --> 21:08.420
It's strange!

21:08.960 --> 21:10.500
Maybe not.

21:10.500 --> 21:14.630
I've been told "You're strange" for a long time,
even while I was growing up.

21:17.040 --> 21:19.630
Due to that...

21:19.630 --> 21:22.960
I thought I'd keep this a secret, but...

21:23.790 --> 21:26.040
I was best friends with your father.

21:26.040 --> 21:28.460
That man was the only one who would
treat even an oddball like me

21:28.460 --> 21:30.130
as if I were any normal person.

21:32.580 --> 21:36.710
I'm glad to see that you've also
made a good friend.

21:40.460 --> 21:42.750
Everyone is truly kind.

21:43.330 --> 21:47.080
But that doesn't make me feel any better.

21:48.000 --> 21:51.380
Miss Terakomari. Will you punish me?

21:53.920 --> 21:57.380
Okay. Then come be with me.

21:59.130 --> 22:01.380
Stare.

22:01.830 --> 22:04.290
And what does that mean, Lady Komari?

22:04.290 --> 22:07.750
Staaaaare.
Oh, sorry! I didn't mean it like that...<b></b>

22:07.750 --> 22:08.540
Oh, sorry! I didn't mean it like that...

22:08.540 --> 22:11.000
As a reward for winning
the Crimson Lord's War,

22:11.000 --> 22:14.500
I'm going on a two week long
vacation starting now.

22:14.500 --> 22:17.170
Of course, I plan on just
holing up in my room, but...

22:17.540 --> 22:21.380
I might want to hang out
with someone sometimes.

22:21.380 --> 22:24.580
So come on over when I call for you.

22:25.000 --> 22:27.670
That's not much of a punishment...

22:27.670 --> 22:31.130
Okay then, I'll also ask you for
advice on my novels.

22:31.130 --> 22:33.790
There's still a ton of subjects
I want to write about.

22:33.790 --> 22:37.540
And that is quite a pain in the butt,
if I say so myself!

22:37.540 --> 22:39.040
I hope you're ready for it!

22:41.290 --> 22:42.460
Right!

22:42.460 --> 22:45.250
When you call me,
I'll come running straight away!

22:45.250 --> 22:47.630
And stop addressing me like that.

22:47.630 --> 22:51.170
You and I are... well, you know.

22:51.170 --> 22:53.210
We're... friends.

22:54.080 --> 22:56.580
Okay, what do I call you?

22:58.080 --> 22:59.630
Call me "Komari."

23:02.880 --> 23:05.540
I'm happy to be your friend, Miss Komari.

23:19.290 --> 23:23.080
"Mercy of the Lonely Crimson"
is no normal Core Implosion.

23:23.420 --> 23:26.080
You're right.

23:26.080 --> 23:30.540
Taking Terakomari Gandesblood lightly
will lead to misfortune.

23:30.960 --> 23:34.250
But that isn't a problem.

23:34.580 --> 23:36.920
I have you all with me.

23:39.460 --> 23:42.380
Inverse Moon will support you
with all we have.

23:42.380 --> 23:43.750
At least, part of the way.

23:43.750 --> 23:45.210
I know that.

23:45.580 --> 23:49.920
Until Gerra-Aruka destroys
all the other Dark Cores,

23:50.960 --> 23:53.580
we'll get along well, won't we?

23:58.630 --> 24:01.040
<b>A Sapphire Tea Party</b>

23:58.960 --> 24:00.460
"A Sapphire Tea Party."
